# CrewCut tool server (stage B)
Run per task sandbox (needs python deps `requests pyyaml mcp`, ffmpeg):

    python -m toolserver.server --sandbox DIR --tier T0|T1 --log DIR/log.jsonl --budget USD \
        --run-id RUN --task-id TASK [--profile smoke] [--port 8765]

MCP (streamable HTTP at /mcp) with tools image_generate, image_edit, speech_synthesize, music_generate,
sfx_generate, (T1) video_generate, media_ffmpeg; each takes an optional `actor`. Without MCP, import
`toolserver.server.ToolServer(...).call(tool, args, actor)`.
Environment for the hosted back ends: GOOGLE_GEMINI_BASE_URL, GEMINI_API_KEY, ELEVENLABS_API_KEY,
DASHSCOPE_BASE_URL, DASHSCOPE_API_KEY. `--profile smoke` uses placeholders. Prices: configs/tools.yaml.
Test: `python tests/test_toolserver.py`.
